<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} --><h1 class="wp-block-heading">One family.<br>A world at <span class="fr-script">prayer.</span></h1><!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-lead"} --><p class="fr-lead">Before the crowds, the cameras and the radio broadcasts, there was a family praying the Rosary at home.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This is the story of Venerable Patrick Peyton, and an invitation that still belongs to every family.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->

