<!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">An invitation across the world.</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>From letters and broadcasts to Rosary rallies, Father Peyton brought family prayer into public life. The ministry’s archive records gatherings in New Orleans, Manila, Barcelona and Mérida.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The scale was extraordinary. The invitation was still personal: bring prayer home to your own family.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-story-milestone"} --><p class="fr-story-milestone">1959 · Manila, Philippines</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->

</div><!-- /wp:group -->
